<title>JAPAN: Tottori Bank denies market rumours on merger.</title>
<headline>Tottori Bank denies market rumours on merger.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tottori Bank Ltd on Friday denied market rumours that it would merge with Sumitomo Bank Ltd or Sanwa Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>A bank spokesman also said that the bank president would hold a news conference in Tottori prefecture at 3.45 p.m. (0645 GMT) on its business activities.  </p>
<p>The spokesman said that the announcement would not cause worries about Japan's financial system.</p>
<p>Tottori Bank is an unlisted regional bank based in western Japan.</p>
</text>
